## Instructions

- Extract metadata based strictly on the document content. Do not infer beyond what is stated.
- For every field provide:
  - `value`: the extracted value (use an empty string if not present in the document)
  - `confidence`: a float 0.0–1.0 indicating certainty (use a low value for empty/absent fields)
  - `reasoning`: one sentence citing where in the document you found the value
- For fields with allowed values, `value` must exactly match one of the listed options or be an empty string.
- For all other fields, use the exact wording from the document.

